388→    /** Sort the ROWS of this range in place. ⚠️ Only columns INSIDE this range move
389→     *  with each row; columns outside the range stay put. Sorting a range narrower
390→     *  than the data block TEARS every record horizontally (irreversible) — the sort
391→     *  range MUST span the block's full width. Boundary depends on read_table's
